      difficulty: {
        easy: 'Legal',
        medium: 'As Tute',
        hard: null,
      },
      considerations: [
        'Be first to reach 101 or more points from tricks, singing (20/40), and last trick (10); or declare tute (four kings or four horses) after winning a trick to win immediately.',
        'Non-dealer leads. Until stock is exhausted: no follow suit or trump required; second player may play any card. Winner of trick draws from stock first, then opponent; face-up trump is last card drawn. After stock empty: must follow suit and beat if possible, trump if cannot follow. After winning a trick, may sing one 40 or 20; tute wins the game. Trump 7 or 2 may be exchanged for turned card before play. Wrong claim of 101+ loses.',
        'Corriente',
        'Relaxed play until stock empty, then follow suit',
      ],
    },
